@startuml UC66_ExportPDF
!theme plain
title UC66: Xuất báo cáo PDF

actor Admin
participant "Admin Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB
participant "jsPDF Library" as PDF

Admin -> Frontend: Chọn bộ lọc\n(status, source, dateRange)
Admin -> Frontend: Click "Xuất PDF"
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/bookings\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: filters)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role = admin
API -> DB: Query bookings với filters\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId)
DB --> API: Filtered bookings

Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/invoices\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: filters)
API -> DB: Query invoices với filters\n(populate bookingId, customerId)
DB --> API: Filtered invoices

Frontend -> Frontend: Tính toán thống kê từ dữ liệu đã lọc

Frontend -> PDF: Tạo PDF document mới
PDF --> Frontend: PDF document created

Frontend -> PDF: Thêm tiêu đề\n("Báo cáo Dashboard", font size 20)
PDF --> Frontend: Title added

Frontend -> PDF: Thêm thống kê\n(totalBookings, currentGuests, revenue, paymentRate)
PDF --> Frontend: Statistics added

Frontend -> PDF: Thêm bảng dữ liệu\n(bookings table với autoTable)
PDF --> Frontend: Table added

Frontend -> PDF: Thêm đóng dấu/watermark\n(logo, company info, date)
PDF --> Frontend: Watermark added

Frontend -> PDF: Xuất file PDF\n(filename: dashboard_YYYY-MM-DD.pdf)
PDF --> Admin: Download file PDF

API --> Frontend: Success + data (bookings, invoices)
Frontend --> Admin: File PDF đã được tải xuống\n(định dạng chuẩn, đóng dấu)
@enduml

